<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 667)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Notes in order of scope.</b> The sidebar now has two fields instead of one with a globe switch: <b>Session note (whole review)</b> at the top, and the note for the frame you are on at the bottom, beside the transport.</li>
<li><b>Saved copies follow the host.</b> If the host of a web review turns off saved copies mid-review, open pages stop saving and remove their copy right away.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
